  continuous["B / F01-F15<br/>Continuous pipelines and fixed reads<br/>LUTRAM FIFOs, online padding<br/>Split windows, channel rotation, registered trees<br/>Avoid pixel restarts and reduce wide selectors"]
  combination["C01-C12 / combined experiments<br/>Winograd plus packing/mixed precision<br/>Lowest raw estimate C11: 1.0817 ms<br/>LUT 248797 / FF 307525<br/>Resource limits exclude it from candidate ranking"]
  loader["F16-F24<br/>Output conversion and loader timing<br/>F20: exact float encoding, zero DSPs<br/>F24: explicit 3D weight-loader indices<br/>Global critical path moves to loader counters"]
  f25["F25 / direct-convolution candidate<br/>Disable F24 weight-loader flattening<br/>HLS about 2.64226 ms / DSP 502<br/>BRAM18K 73 / LUT 69976<br/>2.5 ns still warns after clock uncertainty"]
