  t8["W19-W21 / F29-F30<br/>Winograd T8 with subkernel-indexed cache<br/>W19 misses LUT budget; W21 fits with 898 LUT spare<br/>Direct T8 controls still exceed budgets<br/>W21: HLS 525237 cycles; F97: RTL 558758 cycles"]
